WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:27.614
Cat saw Farmer's truck.

2
00:00:27.615 --> 00:00:31.986
She jumped into the back.

3
00:00:31.987 --> 00:00:40.421
Soon she was asleep.

4
00:00:40.422 --> 00:00:45.004
Farmer got into the truck.

5
00:00:45.005 --> 00:00:46.623
Vroom!

6
00:00:46.624 --> 00:00:49.213
Off they went!

7
00:00:49.214 --> 00:00:53.342
Cat woke up.

8
00:00:53.343 --> 00:00:59.291
"The truck is moving!" she said.

9
00:00:59.292 --> 00:01:05.477
The park went by.

10
00:01:05.478 --> 00:01:09.575
A school went by.

11
00:01:09.576 --> 00:01:16.457
The sun was moving too.

12
00:01:16.458 --> 00:01:23.508
"Where are we going?" said Cat.

13
00:01:23.509 --> 00:01:28.995
At last the truck stopped.

14
00:01:28.996 --> 00:01:30.974
Farmer got out.

15
00:01:30.975 --> 00:01:36.095
He walked away.

16
00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:39.410
Cat looked around.

17
00:01:39.411 --> 00:01:42.955
"Where am I?" she asked.

18
00:01:42.956 --> 00:01:45.813
Cat saw a tall pole.

19
00:01:45.814 --> 00:01:47.868
She saw a bank.

20
00:01:47.869 --> 00:01:50.879
She saw many shops.

21
00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:54.600
"We are in town!" said Cat.

22
00:01:54.601 --> 00:01:56.817
"I will walk around.

23
00:01:56.818 --> 00:01:59.037
It will be fun!"

24
00:01:59.038 --> 00:02:01.336
Cat jumped down.

25
00:02:01.337 --> 00:02:05.995
And off she went!

